    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527260/extras/d75bb1483f223bb88496d17833fdaae7.webp?t=1740196860\" /></span><br><br>Find yourself in the world of <strong>Cyber Cell</strong>. A crumbling world full of enemies that want to stop you from reaching the top.<br><br>Inspired by the classics such as DOOM, Quake, Duke Nukem, or any other &quot;boomer shooter&quot; you can think of. Unique level design all with different map puzzles and interactive environments. Combat is meant to be fast paced and geared toward creating exciting and satisfying ways to kill your enemies.<br><br><strong>WISHLIST</strong> today!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527260/extras/d75bb1483f223bb88496d17833fdaae7.webp?t=1740196860\" /></span><br><br>Find yourself in the world of <strong>Cyber Cell</strong>. A crumbling world full of enemies that want to stop you from reaching the top.<br><br>Inspired by the classics such as DOOM, Quake, Duke Nukem, or any other &quot;boomer shooter&quot; you can think of. Unique level design all with different map puzzles and interactive environments. Combat is meant to be fast paced and geared toward creating exciting and satisfying ways to kill your enemies.<br><br><strong>WISHLIST</strong> today!",
    "short_description": "Set in a post apocalyptic world, Cyber Cell is a fast paced shooter meant to be both challenging and satisfying. Fight your way through the levels to find out who is behind your suffering.",
